bsp;&nbsp; </span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">주전공은 교육과정 이수기준표에 따라 이수, 복수전공은 39학점 이상을 이수</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">자연과학계열 및 인문사회계열은 입학년도에 관계없이 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -41.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 주전공 45학점 이상 및 복수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전공 39학점 이상을 이수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -40.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011학년도 이후 입학자</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 중 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">컴퓨터공학과 복수전공은 43학점 이상,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -40.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 컴퓨터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">소프트웨어공학과 복수전공은 50학점 이상 이수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -40.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 주전공 과목이 복수전공 과목과 동일한(학부 지정) 경우 9학점까지 복수전공 학점으로 인정함. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -40.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다만, 교직과정 이수자는 중복 인정하지 않음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -40.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">10. </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기타사항 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">복수전공은 공학교육인정과정을 적용하지 아니함</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p sty